fuxi: 0126 -- say which present path runs, and what the copy moves

Two grabs 20 s apart differ by 21 of 162000 pixels while the compositor reports 9000
swaps, and forcing the copy path (sweetfb_copy=1) did not change what the panel shows.
Either the copy path does not run, or the panel scans a buffer the capture is not reading
-- and those need opposite fixes, so guess is worse than instrument.

The first six presents now report whether they went through directPresent() or the CPU
copy, and every copy names the surface, its geometry and the source pointer.

Diagnostic only.

